HSK 3.0 (2025 syllabus) vocabulary
==================================

The level assignments, cleaned English definitions and pinyin in
data/vocab.json are derived from the HSK 3.0 2025 vocabulary dataset:

  Source:  https://github.com/bezlant/hsk-3-vocabulary
           (HSKStory, "HSK 3.0 Vocabulary Lists")
  Levels:  https://github.com/chelsea6502/hsk-2025-data
           (2025 syllabus data sourced from chinesetest.cn)
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

  The word scope and levels follow the 新版HSK考试大纲 published by the
  Center for Language Education and Cooperation in November 2025, which is
  built on 《国际中文教育中文水平等级标准》 (GF 0025-2021).

English glosses are also derived from CC-CEDICT; see LICENSE-CC-CEDICT.
The derived deck in data/vocab.json is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
The application code remains under its own license.
